    "Question #: 7": {
      "Title": "Exam 199-01 topic 1 question 62 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which statements are true regarding the default methods by which load-balancing takes place in the Interceptor appliance. (Select 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. The Interceptor appliance uses round robin, for each TCP connection, regardless of source or destination IP address, and is equally load-balanced between a group of Steelhead appliances"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. The Interceptor appliance uses round robin, for each TCP connection, depending on source IP address, and is equally load-balanced between a group of Steelhead appliances"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. The Interceptor appliance uses hash assignment, for each TCP connection depending the hash value calculated from source and destination IP address, and is directed to a particular Steelhead appliance in the local cluster"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. The Interceptor appliance can dynamically determine and direct traffic for optimization to the least-loaded Steelhead appliances based on Steelhead appliance resource usage"
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. The Interceptor appliance uses peer affinity, a Steelhead appliance in the local cluster that has been previously paired with a destination IP address is preferred"
            }
          ]
        },
        "F": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "F. The Interceptor appliance uses peer affinity, a Steelhead appliance in the local cluster that has been previously paired with a remote Steelhead appliance is"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": []
    },
